--- table records
mt_plain: no record
log_plain: no record
tinylog_plain: no record
stripelog_plain: no record
mt_dynamic: record origin: official_canonical
mt_json: record origin: official_canonical
mt_state: record origin: official_canonical
log_state: record origin: official_canonical
log_plain: no record
--- ALTER gives a table its first such column
mt_alter: no record
mt_alter: record origin: official_canonical
1	\N	None
2	x	String
3	3	UInt512
registered after the ALTER: refused
mt_alter: record origin: official_canonical
--- parts move between tables without such data, whatever their origins
p_new: no record
p_reg: record origin: sentio_legacy_v0
p_canon: record origin: official_canonical
p_new	1	1.5
p_new	2	2.5
p_reg	2	2.5
p_reg	3	3.5
p_canon	1	1.5
p_canon	2	2.5
--- tables with such data keep the check
s_canon: record origin: official_canonical
s_unset: no record
ATTACH PARTITION FROM a table without an origin: refused
--- detached parts
part records detached from a canonical table without such data: 0
d_dst	5	5.5
a part with such data without a record into a registered table: refused
--- a detached part whose files changed after its record was written
record: origin: official_canonical
1	x	String
2	3	UInt512
3	-7	Int512
